---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Antique Radio Salvage | We Buy, Sell & Test Vacuum Tubes" description="Antique Radio Salvage buys, sells and professionally tests vacuum tubes, collections and related vintage electronics." current="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Vacuum tube specialists · Massachusetts</p>
        <h1>We Buy, Sell &amp; <em>Test Vacuum Tubes</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Professional tube testing, matching and collection purchasing for collectors, audiophiles, musicians, radio operators, repair shops and estates.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="/selling/">Sell Your Tubes</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="/testing/">Professional Tube Testing</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trustline"><span>Established eBay seller</span><span>Professional test equipment</span><span>Nationwide service</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Vintage vacuum tube buying artwork">
        <div class="poster-frame"><img src="/images/tube-buying-poster.png" alt="Antique Radio Salvage vacuum tube buying artwork" /></div>
        <div class="lab-card"><div class="tube-symbol"></div><strong>Knowledgeable evaluation</strong><span>From single rare tubes to complete inherited collections.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats">
    <div class="container stats-grid">
      <div class="stat"><strong>Since 2003</strong><span>Selling online</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>72,000+</strong><span>Items sold</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>99.8%</strong><span>Positive feedback</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>Nationwide</strong><span>Buying & testing</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">How we can help</p><h2>Three clear ways to work with us</h2></div><p>Whether you inherited tubes, need reliable measurements or are searching for tested inventory, you will know exactly where to begin.</p></div>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Sell Your Tubes</h3><p>We purchase individual tubes, collections, estates, repair-shop inventory, testers and related vintage electronics.</p><a href="/selling/">Learn about selling</a></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Professional Testing</h3><p>Testing can include plate current, mutual conductance, emission, gas, shorts, leakage and matching.</p><a href="/testing/">Explore testing services</a></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Shop Tested Tubes</h3><p>Browse tested vacuum tubes, radio parts, accessories and other vintage items through our established eBay store.</p><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/antiqueradiosalvage" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit our eBay store</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="image-shell"><img src="/images/tube-buying-poster.png" alt="We buy vacuum tubes and collections" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Inherited or accumulated tubes?</p><h2>You do not need to know what you have.</h2><p class="lead">A collection can be overwhelming—especially when it was inherited. We help identify what matters, explain the options and make straightforward offers without requiring you to sort or test everything first.</p><div class="checklist"><div class="check">Inherited collections</div><div class="check">Collectors downsizing</div><div class="check">Repair-shop inventory</div><div class="check">Estate liquidations</div><div class="check">Tube testers & equipment</div><div class="check">Local or shipped collections</div></div><a class="btn primary" href="/selling/">How the buying process works</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Simple process</p><h2>From first contact to a clear next step</h2></div><p>Send basic information first. We will guide you on photos, packing, shipping or local pickup based on the size and type of collection.</p></div>
      <div class="process"><div class="step"><span>1</span><h3>Contact us</h3><p>Tell us what you have, approximately how much and where it is located.</p></div><div class="step"><span>2</span><h3>Share photos</h3><p>We will explain which overview and label photos are most useful.</p></div><div class="step"><span>3</span><h3>Review options</h3><p>We evaluate the material and discuss purchase, shipment or pickup.</p></div><div class="step"><span>4</span><h3>Complete the sale</h3><p>We agree on the details and arrange prompt payment.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container testing-panel">
      <div><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#d6b37e">More than good or bad</p><h2>Professional equipment. Useful results.</h2><p>Different tubes and applications call for different test methods. We use equipment including the Amplitrex AT-1000, calibrated TV-7, Hickok testers, MAXIPREAMP II, Sencore and B&amp;K equipment.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn brass" href="/testing/">See our testing service</a></div></div>
      <div class="measurements"><div class="measurement"><strong>Plate Current</strong><span>Operating current measurement</span></div><div class="measurement"><strong>Gm</strong><span>Mutual conductance</span></div><div class="measurement"><strong>Emission</strong><span>Cathode performance</span></div><div class="measurement"><strong>Gas</strong><span>Grid-current indication</span></div><div class="measurement"><strong>Leakage</strong><span>Insulation condition</span></div><div class="measurement"><strong>Matching</strong><span>Pairs and groups</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section warm"><div class="container quote"><blockquote>“The goal is not simply to produce a number—it is to provide measurements that are useful for the tube and its intended application.”</blockquote><cite>Antique Radio Salvage · Hudson, Massachusetts</cite></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ready to get started?</p><h2>Tell us about your tubes or testing needs.</h2><p>Use one contact form for selling, testing, product questions, listing questions or general inquiries.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact/">Contact Antique Radio Salvage</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
